  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 75,
    "summary": "The righteous praise and thank the God of Jacob—They will be exalted—God is the judge, and the wicked will be condemned.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Unto thee, O God, do we give thanks, unto thee do we give thanks: for that thy name is near thy wondrous works declare.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 37,
            "end": 46
          },
          {
            "start": 70,
            "end": 74
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "When I shall receive the congregation I will judge uprightly.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The earth and all the inhabitants thereof are dissolved: I bear up the pillars of it. Selah.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 71,
            "end": 78,
            "text": "1 Sam. 2:8."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "I said unto the fools, Deal not foolishly: and to the wicked, Lift not up the horn:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "Hel. 9:21."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Lift not up your horn on high: speak not with a stiff neck.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 48,
            "end": 53,
            "text": "TG Stiffnecked."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 37,
            "end": 45
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For promotion cometh neither from the east, nor from the west, nor from the south.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 13,
            "text": "Jer. 27:5 (5–6); Dan. 2:21; 5:20 (18–20)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 14,
            "end": 20
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "But God is the judge: he putteth down one, and setteth up another.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 20,
            "text": "Mosiah 29:12; D&C 64:11; Moses 6:57."
          },
          {
            "start": 33,
            "end": 37,
            "text": "1 Sam. 2:7."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 10
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For in the hand of the Lord there is a cup, and the wine is red; it is full of mixture; and he poureth out of the same: but the dregs thereof, all the wicked of the earth shall wring them out, and drink them.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 39,
            "end": 42,
            "text": "Mosiah 3:26 (24–26); Alma 40:26."
          },
          {
            "start": 197,
            "end": 202,
            "text": "Job 21:20."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 28,
            "end": 36
          },
          {
            "start": 183,
            "end": 187
          },
          {
            "start": 193,
            "end": 196
          },
          {
            "start": 203,
            "end": 208
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "But I will declare for ever; I will sing praises to the God of Jacob.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "All the horns of the wicked also will I cut off; but the horns of the righteous shall be exalted.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 13,
            "text": "1 Sam. 2:1; Jer. 48:25."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 49,
            "end": 52
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
  },
